{
  "cited_article_id": "configure-automated-reminders",
  "reply": "Make sure each patient has a verified mobile number and the communication opt‑in is enabled. Then open Reports > Message Log to see if any reminders show a ‘Failed’ status; if they do, check whether the failure is due to carrier blocking and confirm the phone number supports SMS. To adjust the send time, go to Settings > Communications > Reminders and set the dispatch window to any value between 24‑72 hours before the appointment, then click Save Changes."
}
